            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2 GHz Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA or AMD 3D graphics card with Shader Model 3.0 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Integrated graphics processors like the Intel GMA series might work but are not officially supported. The ATI Radeon X1000 series is not supported because it does not fully comply with Shader Model 3.0 standards.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2 Ghz multicore Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GTX260 or higher / AMD Radeon HD 4870 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 3 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>"
